 "map_info": {
  "name": "Random: Entropy",
  "title": "Random_Entropy",
  "lookup_name": "Random_Entropy",
  "description": "The entropy pocket gets its own room. Surprise, measured: the Shannon meter reads disorder in bits at the center; a jar of order decays in your hand; hardware entropy leaks; true and pseudo randomness stand side by side for comparison. At the dark end, a sphere you cannot predict and butterflies that will not repeat. Entropy is not mess - it is how much you do not know yet.",
